name: ['Akroma, Angel of Wrath', 'Arena', 'Assault // Battery', 'Auratog', 'Avalanche Riders', 'Avatar of Woe', 'Avoid Fate', 'Bad Moon', 'Browbeat', 'Call of the Herd', 'Celestial Dawn', 'Claws of Gix', 'Coalition Victory', 'Cockatrice', 'Consecrate Land', 'Conspiracy', 'Craw Giant', 'Dandân', 'Darkness', 'Dauthi Slayer', 'Defiant Vanguard', 'Desert', 'Desolation Giant', 'Disenchant', 'Disintegrate', 'Dodecapod', 'Dragon Whelp', 'Dragonstorm', 'Enduring Renewal', 'Eron the Relentless', 'Essence Sliver', 'Evil Eye of Orms-by-Gore', 'Faceless Butcher', "Feldon's Cane", 'Fiery Justice', 'Fiery Temper', 'Fire Whip', 'Flying Men', 'Funeral Charm', "Gaea's Blessing", "Gaea's Liege", 'Gemstone Mine', 'Ghost Ship', 'Giant Oyster', 'Goblin Snowman', 'Grinning Totem', 'Hail Storm', 'Honorable Passage', 'Hunting Moa', 'Icatian Javelineers', 'Jasmine Boreal', 'Jolrael, Empress of Beasts', 'Kobold Taskmaster', 'Krosan Cloudscraper', 'Leviathan', 'Lightning Angel', 'Lord of Atlantis', 'Merfolk Assassin', 'Merieke Ri Berit', 'Mindless Automaton', 'Mirari', 'Mistform Ultimus', 'Moorish Cavalry', 'Mystic Enforcer', 'Mystic Snake', 'Nicol Bolas', 'Orcish Librarian', 'Orgg', 'Ovinomancer', 'Pandemonium', 'Pendelhaven', 'Pirate Ship', 'Prodigal Sorcerer', 'Psionic Blast', 'Resurrection', 'Sacred Mesa', 'Safe Haven', 'Scragnoth', 'Sengir Autocrat', 'Serrated Arrows', 'Shadow Guildmage', 'Shadowmage Infiltrator', 'Sindbad', "Sol'kanar the Swamp King", 'Soltari Priest', 'Soul Collector', 'Spike Feeder', 'Spined Sliver', 'Spitting Slug', 'Squire', 'Stormbind', 'Stormscape Familiar', 'Stupor', "Suq'Ata Lancer", 'Swamp Mosquito', "Teferi's Moat", 'Thallid', 'The Rack', 'Thornscape Battlemage', "Tormod's Crypt", 'Tribal Flames', 'Twisted Abomination', 'Uncle Istvan', 'Undead Warchief', 'Undertaker', 'Unstable Mutation', 'Uthden Troll', 'Valor', 'Verdeloth the Ancient', 'Vhati il-Dal', 'Void', 'Voidmage Prodigy', 'Wall of Roots', 'War Barge', 'Whirling Dervish', 'Whispers of the Muse', 'Wildf